1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:02,020
In this town, everybody can cook.

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:04,335
HUSS! HUSS! HUSS! HUSS! HUSS! HUSS!

3
00:00:04,335 --> 00:00:07,489
Grandma bakes pies so good, the birds line up outside.

4
00:00:07,419 --> 00:00:09,831
The mailman flips pancakes over his own house.

5
00:00:09,931 --> 00:00:12,004
Except me. I burned water. Twice.

6
00:00:12,054 --> 00:00:13,572
The smoke alarm knows my name.

7
00:00:13,672 --> 00:00:16,890
Then came the town cook-off. First prize: the golden spoon.

8
00:00:16,890 --> 00:00:20,241
Everybody looked at me and said: Leo, please. Remember the water.

9
00:00:20,341 --> 00:00:24,559
So I trained. Toast. Burned. Cereal. Burned. Ice cream. Somehow, burned.

10
00:00:24,609 --> 00:00:26,216
Then Grandma told me her secret.

11
00:00:26,166 --> 00:00:28,837
You don't cook with your hands, Leo. You cook with your huss.

12
00:00:28,937 --> 00:00:32,466
Cook-off day. I had one raw pizza. And no oven.

13
00:00:32,466 --> 00:00:34,603
The judge sighed. Everybody laughed.

14
00:00:34,603 --> 00:00:36,582
I took the biggest breath of my life.

15
00:00:36,582 --> 00:00:37,392
HUSS!

16
00:00:37,442 --> 00:00:40,843
The pizza spun so fast, it cooked itself. Perfectly golden.

17
00:00:40,843 --> 00:00:42,924
The judge took one bite, and cried.

18
00:00:42,924 --> 00:00:43,786
Golden spoon.

19
00:00:43,886 --> 00:00:46,256
Now everybody in this town cooks with a huss.

20
00:00:46,156 --> 00:00:48,927
HUSS! HUSS! HUSS! HUSS! HUSS! HUSS!

